text.paragraph:
If certain uridine diphosphate glucuronosyltransferase (UGT)1A or cytochrome P450 (CYP)3A inducers are co‑administered, then administer the corresponding dose of TIVICAY PD (see 
Table 3
) or TIVICAY (see 
Table 4
) twice daily instead of once daily (i.e., double the total daily dosage) [see Drug Interactions (


   7.2
   , 
   7.3
   )]

.
